Keetar's @keetar/core package includes source code (packages/core/src/{crypto,kdbx,defs,errors,utils}/)
bootstrapped from gynet/keewebx's packages/db (https://github.com/gynet/keewebx), which is itself a fork
of kdbxweb by Antelle (https://github.com/keeweb/kdbxweb).

Attribution chain, as documented by keewebx's own package.json:

  Antelle (original kdbxweb author, https://antelle.net)
    -> gynet/keewebx (fork, https://github.com/gynet/keewebx)
      -> Keetar (this project)

